{
  "id": "wraith_uniform",
  "item": "WNG_WraithUniform",
  "faction": "Wraith",
  "purpose": "Everyday Wraith uniform derived from Stargate Atlantis male Wraith production clothing: a fitted green-black leather uniform/vest ensemble with black reptile-pattern leather, practical hidden closures, side/back lacing and subdued shoulder construction. It must read as real Stargate wardrobe beneath armour, not as a generic sci-fi bodysuit or segmented armour.",
